flowchart TB
  UI[React Renderer] -->|Typed IPC| Host[Electron Host / Preload]
  Host -->|Private local protocol| App[App Server]
  App --> Product[(SQLite product state)]
  App --> Resolver[Package / Skill Resolver]
  Resolver --> Lock[Immutable Run ResourceLock]
  App --> Worker[Dedicated Pi Worker]
  Lock --> Worker
  Worker --> Native[(Pi-owned transcripts)]
  Worker -->|Controlled tools| Broker[Policy / Tool / Connector Brokers]
  Broker --> Backend[ExecutionBackend]
  Backend --> Mac[macOS host]
  Backend --> Win[Windows host]
  Backend --> WSL[WSL runtime - not a sandbox]
  Backend --> Iso[Isolated backend - verified capabilities]
  Broker --> Artifact[Artifact Service / Blob Store]
  Host --> Secret[OS Secret Store]
  App -. optional .-> Registry[Signed catalog and revocations]
